# Claude Code
# Share CLAUDE.md and .claude/skills/ — they are project assets. Keep
# per-machine settings out: settings.local.json holds local tool permissions
# and differs per developer. Declared here rather than relying on a personal
# global gitignore, so the rule holds for everyone who clones this repo.
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/settings.local.json.backup

